AUDIO: 'the resolution I use 4K. In my opinion, this&nbsp; is one of the most important settings when&nbsp;&nbsp; it comes to create data set images because we&nbsp; want the best quality we can get here to avoid&nbsp;&nbsp; character drifts as much as possible later on.&nbsp; For the aspect ratio, I use 3 to four because it&nbsp;&nbsp;'

[03:30] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
